{
    "title": "Bingo Party - Lucky Bingo Game",
    "description": "\ud83e\udd23Join Bingo Party to play Bingo with friends\ud83d\udc95 and millions of players around the world. \r\nPlay in hundreds of bingo rooms!\r\nNo matter where you are, no matter what time, you can enjoy the joy of BINGO at your fingertips in Bingo Party!\r\n\r\n\r\n   \ud83c\udf88Game Features\ud83c\udf88\r\n\u2728Welcome bonus- Start the travel with 500 tickets and 30 powerups!\r\n\u2728Daily Tournament- Compete with other players to win more!\r\n\u2728Multiple card play- One bingo card is SO easy- play multiple free bingo games at the same time!\r\n\u27287 Powerups: Need a little extra? Grab powerups for even bigger bingo wins!\r\n\u2728Daily tasks, make every bingo worth more rewards\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0Family System\r\nCreate or join a family to play with your friends or family together.\r\nHelp each other in your family with tickets, powerups or cards to grow faster.\r\nCome and Fight for your family to upgrade your family chest!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf08Hundreds of Bingo rooms to enjoy!\r\nBingo rooms with distinctive styles from all over the world!\r\nBingo rooms with the style of every special day!\r\n\r\nThere are other mysterious Bingo rooms waiting for you to explore!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd73Don\u2019t want to play alone?\r\nLog in your game with your Facebook and unlock the following privileges!\r\nYou can synchronize your game progress on any device.\r\nFollow our fun page and get the first-hand information.\r\nInvite your family and friends to play together.  \r\n\r\n\r\nEvery two weeks there will be a new Odyssey challenge, more rewards and cards are waiting for you!\r\n\r\nNew content is added to the game every week, never get bored here!\r\n\r\nInstall Bingo Party now! You will discover an incredible world of Bingo games. Wherever you are, you can open the Bingo Party to experience a wonderful BINGO world!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\ud83c\udf40\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c\tFan Page\r\nFollow Bingo Party on Facebook for free offers and exclusive packages.\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/BingoPartyTour\r\n\r\n\u2753\tQuestions or Comments\r\nFeel free to contact our support team through the \u201cSupport\u201d tab in the Setting page.\r\nYou can also send us an email directly to bingo@avid.ly\r\n\r\n\u2757\tDisclaimer\r\n- The casino game is intended for adult audiences over the age of 18 and is for entertainment purposes only.\r\n- The casino game does not offer real money gambling or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.\r\n- Any success in social casino gambling is not indicative of future success at real money gambling.",
